      "message": "Unfortunately there are other ways for a VPN to be fully routed. You could get a more precise answer with NetworkUtils.routedIPv{4,6}AddressCount (for usage, see the infamous Vpn#providesRoutesToMostDestinations which I believe you are already familiar with), but that\u0027s expensive. You could compute it once and for all and store it in networkMisc or in the Vpn object when the network connects, for example.\n\nOr, you may decide you don\u0027t mind and this is good enough. Maybe +lorenzo@ has an opinion.",
